{"tool_name":"ants:-advanced-normalization-tools","contents":["neubias"],"fetched_metadata":{"neubias":{"body":[{"format":"basic_html","processed":"<p>ANTs computes high-dimensional mappings to capture the statistics of brain structure and function.</p>\n\n<h3>Image Registration</h3>\n\n<p>Diffeomorphisms: <a href=\"http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/17659998\">SyN</a>, Independent Evaluation: <a href=\"http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/19195496\">Klein</a>, <a href=\"http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/21632295\">Murphy</a>, Template Construction <a href=\"http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/15501083\">(2004)</a><a href=\"http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/19818860\">(2010)</a>, <a href=\"http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/20851191\">Similarity Metrics</a>, <a href=\"http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/18995188\">Multivariate registration</a>, <a href=\"http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/23151955\">Multiple modality analysis and statistical bias</a></p>\n\n<h3>Image Segmentation</h3>\n\n<p>Atropos Multivar-EM Segmentation <a href=\"http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/21373993\">(link)</a>, Multi-atlas methods <a href=\"https://scholar.google.com/scholar?q=joint+label+fusion+yushkevich&amp;btnG=&amp;hl=en&amp;as_sdt=0%2C31\">(link)</a> and <a href=\"http://journal.frontiersin.org/article/10.3389/fninf.2013.00027/full\">JLF</a>, Bias Correction <a href=\"http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/20378467\">(link)</a>, DiReCT cortical thickness <a href=\"http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/19150502\">(link)</a>, DiReCT in <a href=\"http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/23516289\">chimpanzees</a></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>","summary":"","value":"<p>ANTs computes high-dimensional mappings to capture the statistics of brain structure and function.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Image Registration</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Diffeomorphisms: <a href=\"http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/17659998\">SyN</a>, Independent Evaluation: <a href=\"http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/19195496\">Klein</a>, <a href=\"http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/21632295\">Murphy</a>, Template Construction <a href=\"http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/15501083\">(2004)</a><a href=\"http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/19818860\">(2010)</a>, <a href=\"http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/20851191\">Similarity Metrics</a>, <a href=\"http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/18995188\">Multivariate registration</a>, <a href=\"http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/23151955\">Multiple modality analysis and statistical bias</a></p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Image Segmentation</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Atropos Multivar-EM Segmentation <a href=\"http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/21373993\">(link)</a>, Multi-atlas methods <a href=\"https://scholar.google.com/scholar?q=joint+label+fusion+yushkevich&amp;btnG=&amp;hl=en&amp;as_sdt=0%2C31\">(link)</a> and <a href=\"http://journal.frontiersin.org/article/10.3389/fninf.2013.00027/full\">JLF</a>, Bias Correction <a href=\"http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/20378467\">(link)</a>, DiReCT cortical thickness <a href=\"http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/19150502\">(link)</a>, DiReCT in <a href=\"http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/23516289\">chimpanzees</a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n"}],"changed":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2018-01-30T14:37:21+00:00"}],"created":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2018-01-30T14:29:40+00:00"}],"default_langcode":[{"value":true}],"attribution_instructions":[],"comments_2023":[],"free_tagging":[],"give_feedback_on_this_soft":[{"cid":0,"comment_count":0,"last_comment_name":null,"last_comment_timestamp":1517323041,"last_comment_uid":284,"status":2}],"has_author":[{"value":"Avants Brian"},{"value":"Tustison Nicholas"},{"value":"Johnson Hans"}],"has_biological_terms":[],"has_comparison":[],"has_documentation":[{"options":[],"title":"","uri":"https://sourceforge.net/projects/advants/files/Documentation/"}],"has_doi":[],"has_entry_curator":[],"has_function":[{"target_id":4055,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"http://edamontology.org/operation_Image_registration","url"